{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04414","headline":"鸳鸯篇 · 陈子昂","name":"鸳鸯篇","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"飞飞鸳鸯鸟，举翼相蔽亏。\n俱来绿潭里，共向白云涯。\n音容相眷恋，羽翮两逶迤。\n苹萍戏春渚，霜霰遶寒池。\n浦沙连岸净，汀树拂潭垂。\n年年此游翫，岁岁来追随。\n凤凰起丹穴，独向梧桐枝。\n鸿雁来紫塞，空忆稻粱肥。\n乌啼倦依托，鹤鸣伤别离。\n岂若此双禽，飞翻不异林。\n刷尾青江浦，交颈紫山岑。\n文章负奇色，和鸣多好音。\n闻有鸳鸯绮，复有鸳鸯衾。\n持爲美人赠，勖此故交心。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"陈子昂","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_04414.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04414","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}